4. USER DATA PRIVACY & FORTIFIED SECURITY
------------------------------------------
MFG Global AI adheres to privacy-by-design standards:
- Local Storage Vault: Chat sessions and history are encrypted locally on the device using
  Android Jetpack Room SQLite Database.
- Zero-Leak Sandbox Memory: Transient inputs and attached media are isolated in memory.
- Network Security: Network transmissions are secured through HTTPS encryption complying
  with Android Network Security Configurations.

